      <slug></slug>
      <title>Moose Primer</title>
      <subtitle></subtitle>
      <track>Perl Devroom</track>
      <type></type>
      <language></language>
      <abstract>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Moose is a post modern object system for Perl 5. It removes the tedium of writing object oriented code and gives developers powerful tools to express themselves. This talk is a bare bones essentials primer to getting a developer&amp;#39;s feet wet with Moose. It will cover class construction, roles, attributes, and type constraints.&lt;/p&gt;      </abstract>
